ind":"announcement","title":"The Wind and The Snow Demo Is Out — Play It During Steam Next Fest!","summary":"The demo for The Wind and The Snow is now available on Steam!This is a narrative adventure with a dreamcore atmosphere, heavily inspired by To The Moon and Undertale.You play as Wilder, who enters a snowbound dream on an important mission — only to lose his memory the moment he arrives. To remember why he came here, he must explore the dream, piece together fragments of his past, solve puzzles, and follow the strange leads in this wild dream.The demo is available now as part of Steam Next Fest. ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T15:05:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690682","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4412610-1835871199315146","game_id":"steam-4412610","kind":"announcement","title":"The Wind and The Snow | Announcement Trailer","summary":"Hello everyone,The Wind and The Snow is a solo indie game that I’ve been developing for the past 4 years. It is an adventure puzzle game with a dreamcore feeling, where you control character “Wilder” navigating in a strange dream, uncover a beautiful and sad story that he has forgotten — It’s a story about love and the unconsoled.Check out the game trailer below:My game inspirations mainly come from my own bad dreams (yeah I have a lot of them). Games like To The Moon and Undertale, and books li","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-23T10:19:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199315146","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4412610":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:29:48Z","status":"ok","all_sources